loom fold=main rungs=79 cohorts=2 lines_each=17 widened_run_self_test=79 widened_run_dependent=62 seated_run_dependent=15 widened_fixed_argv_words=10 imports_added=35
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye run_main lifted here once, reaching three symbols through the rung that handed itself in
file caravan/abandon.rye one of sixty-four rungs whose door became a three-line delegate, its own run_dependent published
file caravan/arrange.rye one of fifteen rungs whose door became the same delegate, the cohort qualifier seated as a published name
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the ceiling comes down 87800 to 86780, the room the fold won handed back
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish repinned to the measured carry, families, and fold queue this lap leaves standing
recommend keep-going the fold queue is measured and its head is plain: seat_the_history at 17 rungs by 72 lines, then seat_the_record at 37 by 30, then read_the_finding at 20 by 55. seat_the_history is the crux -- the deepest body left and the same harness pattern proven twice over now, at forty-three rungs and at seventy-nine. Beside it the machine half of the address space stays owed and named: page-table entry bytes, an ASID from seL4_ASIDPoolBits, and the retype itself. The libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word, still blocking rungs 3 and 4 of the arc.
